:: Mine Intro
<<mine_init>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<shackle_feet>>
<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>>

The stone walls of the tunnels are broken up by wooden supports. Three <<people>> stand in front of a metal gate ahead of you. A <<person1>><<person>> walks up to you, and forces you to turn, giving no regard for your comfort. <<He>> places metal shackles around your ankles. They shut with a click.
<br><br>
"From now on you will do what you're told," <<he>> says as <<he>> tries to pull you through the open gate. "Or we will make you."

<br><br>
<<link [[Follow <<him>>|Mine Intro 2]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Resist|Mine Intro 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>



:: Mine Intro 2
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You pull against <<him>>, trying to break <<his>> grip on you. <<He>> sighs, pulls out a baton, and bashes it against you. You reel backwards. <<pain 15>><<gggpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pulls you through the gate as the other two guards laugh. You hear it slam and lock behind you.
<<else>>
	You follow <<him>> through the gate, you hear it slam and lock behind you.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"From now on you will be given a job every day," <<he>> says, pulling you through the tunnels. "If you resist, you will be punished. You try to escape, you'll get punished. Trust me, you do not want to be punished."

<<if Time.hour lte 5 or Time.hour gte 21>>
	<<He>> pulls you to another metal gate, the guard in front of it opens it up. The <<person>> pushes you through. The gate slams and locks behind you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> pulls you into a cave with a bunch of other people.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Intro]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<endevent>>



:: Mine Return
<<effects>><<set $mine.intro to 1>><<set $outside to 0>>

You approach the metal door leading to the mines. It's covered in police tape. You look around to make sure nobody is watching, then tear it off. You take a deep breath, pull open the door, and walk through. <<stress 2>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
You're hit by a familiar stale air as you walk down the staircase.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine]]>><</link>>



:: Mine
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>

You're in the mines. It's silent.

<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<mine_pregnancy>>
	<<exit>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<mine_passout>>
	<<exit>>
<</if>>

<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
	<<mine_orgasm>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<icon "actions/explore.png">><<link [[Explore (0:30)|Mine Explore]]>><<pass 30>><</link>>
<<if $mine.tunnel.intro and !$mine.tunnel.diamond>>
	<<if $mine.tunnel.collapse lte 10>>
		<br>
		<<icon "ruins.png">><<link [[Collapsed Tunnel|Mine Collapse]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<br>
		<<icon "ruins.png">><<link [[Flooded Tunnel|Mine Flood]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<icon "get-out.png">><<link [[Leave|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><</link>>



:: Mine Explore
<<effects>>

You explore the winding tunnels. The map you took makes it easy to find your way around.

<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<mine_pregnancy>>
	<<exit>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<mine_passout>>
	<<exit>>
<</if>>

<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
	<<mine_orgasm>>
<</if>>

<<set _relativeWeight to 1>>

<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "nothing">>
	You don't find anything of note.
	<br><br>
	<<mine_links>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "gem">>
	<<mine_gem>>
	You find something shiny embedded in the wall of a tunnel.
	<br><br>
	<<icon "pickaxe.png">><<link [[Attempt to mine it (0:30)|Mine Gem]]>><<pass 30>><<tiredness 10>><<set $phase to _gem>><</link>><<pickaxedifficulty _gem_diff_min _gem_diff_max>><<ggtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<mine_links>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "antique">>
	<<set $phase to either("shovelhandle","lantern","rustypickaxe")>>
	You find a 
	<<if $phase is "shovelhandle">>
		shovel handle
	<<elseif $phase is "rustypickaxe">>
		rusty pickaxe
	<<else>>
		$phase
	<</if>> 
	<<print either(
		"under a rock",
		"in a pile of rotten wood",
		"on the ground, you almost tripped on it"
	)>>.
	<br><br>
	<<ind>><<link [[Take it|Mine Antique]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mine_links>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $settings.tentaclesEnabled and $hallucinations gte 2>>
	<<addinlineevent "tentacles">>
		You explore the dim tunnel, until you step on something soft. You look down and see a tentacle on the ground. It wraps around your leg.
		As you try to wrestle free, a slew of other tentacles emerge from the darkness.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Mine Tentacle]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set _relativeWeight++>>
<</if>>

<<if $settings.slimesEnabled and $hallucinations gte 1>>
	<<addinlineevent "slimes">>
		As you're exploring a damp tunnel, you feel something wet land on your back. You reach to wipe it off, and find a large slime. You look up to see several more about to fall on you.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Mine Slime]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set _relativeWeight++>>
<</if>>

<<if !$mine.tunnel.intro>>
	<<addinlineevent "collapsed">>
		As you're exploring, you come across a steep decline. It's covered in mud. You step onto it before <span class="red">you slip on the mud and slide down the tunnel.</span> 
		You reach the bottom and land on hard rock. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Recover|Mine Collapse Intro]]>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<if $settings.lurkersEnabled>>
	<<addinlineevent "lurkers">>
		As you're exploring, you see movement in the corner of your eye. You turn to look, but it's gone. As you're about to continue on, camouflaged creatures fly at you from the wall.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Struggle|Mine Struggle]]>><<set $struggle_start to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<set _relativeWeight++>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "creature" _relativeWeight>>
	<<generateStrangeCreature 1>><<person1>>
	As you're exploring, you come across a dark tunnel. You venture forward, making your way through, until you hear small rocks fall behind you. 
	You turn to look, but nothing's there. You turn to continue, only to see a shape standing in front of you. It lunges, inhuman arms grabbing your body.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Creature Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<runeventpool>>



:: Mine Gem
<<effects>><<wearProp "pickaxe">>

You pick up a pickaxe and try to break the object out of the rock wall.
<<if $pickaxeSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You manage to break the object out of the wall without damaging it.<<ggpickaxe>></span>
	<br><br>
	It's <<mine_gem_collect $phase>> You take it with you.
	<<prof pickaxe 2>>
<<else>>
	<<prof pickaxe 3>>
	You hit it instead, and <span class="red">it shatters into a bunch of small pieces that scatter all over the ground.<<gggpickaxe>></span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mine_links>>



:: Mine Antique
<<effects>>
<<set $antiquemoney += 75>>
<<set _antique to `antique${$phase}`>>
<<museumAntiqueStatus _antique "found">>

<<if $phase is "shovelhandle">>
	<<set _antique to "shovel handle">>
<<elseif $phase is "rustypickaxe">>
	<<set _antique to "rusty pickaxe">>
<<elseif $phase is "lantern">>
	<<set _antique to "lantern">>
<</if>>

<<set _antique_prop to `antique ${_antique}`>>
<<wearProp _antique_prop>>

You take the _antique with you.

<br><br>
<<mine_links>>



